<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal">Dear&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[Insert Name]</span>,</p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b>April is National Volunteer Month – Thank you for all you do!<o:p></o:p></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">Volunteers are the heart of the American Red Cross, and
Blood Program Leaders like YOU are the lifeline to patients in need. Without
your help, we could not fulfill our lifesaving mission. <b><o:p></o:p></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">I would like to personally thank you for stepping up to help
collect and donate lifesaving blood. By opening your doors, you provide a place
for donors in your community to roll up their sleeve to give.<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: red; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">&nbsp;</span><span style="color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">This National Volunteer Month, we are
especially grateful to our Blood Program Leaders for committing to host drives
that help the critical need we anticipate in summer months.</span></span><span style="color:red"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">On behalf of those we serve, thank you once again for your
tremendous efforts. I look forward to continuing to work with you, helping save
lives of those in need. <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></p><div><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[Insert Name]</font></div><div><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></font></div><div><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></div>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
